---
import PageShell from '../../components/PageShell.astro';
import { withBase } from '../../utils/paths';
---

<PageShell title="Scholarship">
  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      My scholarly work during this review period has primarily taken the form of Scholarship of Teaching
      and Scholarship of Application, consistent with the applied nature of my appointment as an Assistant
      Professor of Practice and Curriculum Coordinator. My scholarship has centered on the systematic
      development, evaluation, and application of evidence-informed approaches to online Biology
      education. This work includes curriculum development, instructional design, assessment development,
      faculty support, and the application of pedagogical knowledge to improve online learning at Doane.
    </p>
  </div>

  <nav class="section-links" aria-label="Scholarship sections">
    <a class="section-link" href={withBase('/scholarship/scholarship-of-teaching/')}>
      Scholarship of Teaching
    </a>
    <a class="section-link" href={withBase('/scholarship/scholarship-of-application/')}>
      Scholarship of Application
    </a>
  </nav>
</PageShell>
